	(text "Ring board (docs/DESIGN.md D-50): FR4 1.6 mm round the insert's plug, against the wall.\nJ1: 5 V from the wiring board's J2 over a 6-way 0.5 mm FFC (pinout mirror-symmetric).\nJ2 mates the MSR-2's rear connector CN2 (MSR-2 powered through its 5V pin).\nU1: SHT45, I2C on the MSR-2 bus (SDA = IO1, SCL = IO0).\nJ3: land for the mic carrier (I2S microphone, D-29): SCK = IO4, WS = IO6, SD = IO7.\nH1-H3: SMT spacers under the MSR-2's board. Copper keeps 8 mm from the box opening."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 180 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b4ecc45e-a426-529e-9187-ebe0cb78d41a")
	)
